# WGSL

## Registration

- Import new sources in `src/shaders/registry.js` with `?raw`.
- Shared libs → `IncludesShadersStoreWGSL` under `snow*` keys; `#include<snowFoo>`.
- Full stages → `ShadersStoreWGSL` as `<name>VertexShader` / `<name>PixelShader`.
- Call `registerShaders()` once before any material is built (`main.js`).

## Shared includes (`lib/`)

| Include | Role |
|---------|------|
| `snowNoise` / `snowTerrain` | height / landform (bake + runtime identical) |
| `snowDeform` | deformation buffer sample / displace |
| `snowShading` | BRDF, SSS, glints, shadow filter |
| `snowShadowLookup` | cascade PCSS |
| `snowAtmosphere` | fog / aerial / sky LUT |
| `snowClipmap` | clipmap vertex placement |
| `snowSpellLights` | dynamic light pool (pedestal keys) |
| `snowPostCommon` | post helpers |
| `snowCharSkin` | legacy procedural figure (unwired) |

Authored props use **`prop`** + **`staticDepth`** / **`staticPrepass`** (no skinning in WGSL — CPU-posed positions).

Bake and beauty passes that share landform math must `#include` the same lib — do not duplicate formulas.

## Conventions

- Header comments for non-obvious math (normal combine order, light vector signs).
- Match sibling uniform/texture names so CPU upload paths stay consistent.
- Depth / prepass reuse beauty placement includes where possible.
